{"id":"n73644-2-7","stage":4,"title":"잠꼬대 · 梦话","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73644-2-7-1","ko":"네가 형에게 먼저 사과를 하는 게 좋겠어.","zh":"你最好先向哥哥道歉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"형에게","meaning":"哥，哥哥","explanation":"형：哥，哥哥；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20286","senseId":"1","lemma":"형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형에게","audio":"/audio/c29b2214e140634bfa73.mp3"}},{"text":"먼저","meaning":"先","explanation":"먼저：先","readings":[{"term":"먼저","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54840","senseId":"1","lemma":"먼저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먼저","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3"}},{"text":"사과를","meaning":"道歉","explanation":"사과：道歉；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사과","audio":"/audio/46fc35121d1a4b332863.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15830","senseId":"1","lemma":"사과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사과를","audio":"/audio/ff84ab463028736cf58d.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠어.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠어","audio":"/audio/3b128c5b8414727d9531.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"997d7178d3aa00dd","term":"형","zh":"哥，哥哥","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3","entryId":"20286","definition":"男子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["형"]},{"id":"c1ddf2fcaeed84cd","term":"먼저","zh":"先","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3","entryId":"54840","definition":"在时间或顺序上领先。","pronunciation":["먼저"]},{"id":"46fc35121d1a4b33","term":"사과","zh":"道歉","audio":"/audio/46fc35121d1a4b332863.mp3","entryId":"15830","definition":"承认自己的不是并请求原谅的行为。","pronunciation":["사ː과"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，作，置办","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"制作或准备什么东西。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/eaba7443d4a237dd9e91.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73644-2-7-2","ko":"무슨 잠꼬대 같은 소리야? 나는 아무 잘못도 안 했어.","zh":"你在说些什么胡话？我根本没做错什么。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"3","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"잠꼬대","meaning":"梦话","explanation":"잠꼬대：梦话","readings":[{"term":"잠꼬대","audio":"/audio/15193c4899b234030986.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73644","senseId":"2","lemma":"잠꼬대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠꼬대","audio":"/audio/15193c4899b234030986.mp3"}},{"text":"같은","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은","audio":"/audio/9dce73570f65f8a11961.mp3"}},{"text":"소리야?","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"소리：话，语言；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"2","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리야","audio":"/audio/dfc72ecf5146f3faa97f.mp3"}},{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"아무","meaning":"任何，什么","explanation":"아무：任何，什么","readings":[{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71327","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}},{"text":"잘못도","meaning":"错，错误","explanation":"잘못：错，错误；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62477","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘못도","audio":"/audio/ef04d2afd52bc7548688.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"했어.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어","audio":"/audio/76f3569b074c48dd5200.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于强调预料之外的、不合理的事情。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"15193c4899b23403","term":"잠꼬대","zh":"梦话","audio":"/audio/15193c4899b234030986.mp3","entryId":"73644","definition":"(喻义)不合常理的莫名的话。","pronunciation":["잠꼬대"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"为传达想法或感受而用嗓音表现出来的方式。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"1bb289b6e5d9e641","term":"아무","zh":"任何，什么","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3","entryId":"71327","definition":"用于指不特定的某人或某物。","pronunciation":["아ː무"]},{"id":"cd1c34de004dbb0d","term":"잘못","zh":"错，错误","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3","entryId":"62477","definition":"做不好或做错的事。","pronunciation":["잘몯"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/553e03fd83a0660a539a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.933,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73644","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":141,"sequenceScore":2.7597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你在说些什么胡话？我根本没做错什么。","你最好先向哥哥道歉。","你这么一门心思地看电视，什么时候才学习啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你最好先向哥哥道歉。","你这么一门心思地看电视，什么时候才学习啊？","你在说些什么胡话？我根本没做错什么。"],"answer":2}]}
